			"Message": "chore(Worker): Record prior commit message in machine-readable file\n\nAdd commit-msg.json storing the commit message from the previous\ndocumentation update (Security, Compatibility, License, and Changelog\nsections added to README). This file enables downstream tooling and\naudit pipelines to reference the exact commit message used without\nrelying on git log parsing.\n\nThe message is preserved verbatim from commit a464e68e5720.",
			"SHA": "556f7703671ceeda26797b2b098533da2c81049e"
		},
